OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fnight with outbreaks of light rain or
OL,7,Fdrizzle. Heavier showers develop
OL,8,Foffshore and may affect parts of Kent.
OL,9,FTurning breezy, especially along the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FDry with sunny spells for most
OL,13,Fareas. Coastal showers may continue to
OL,14,Faffect parts of Kent. Windy along the
OL,15,Fcoast. Temperatures around normal for
OL,16,Fthe time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
